# Example list of agent skills folders. Copy this file to agent-dirs in the same
# folder and edit the copy. agent-dirs is per computer and is not committed,
# because two computers can have different agents.
# One agent skills folder per line. Lines starting with # are ignored.
# Keep only the agents installed on this computer, then run .githooks/sync-links.sh once.
~/.claude/skills
~/.codex/skills
~/.gemini/skills
